  VALUE: RQ-H1FWMC-86
  ROLE: Refines

[DESIGN_ITEM]
UID: SW-H1FWMC-206
TITLE: State: Fault
STATEMENT: >>>
The fault state is for when a system error has occurred while the filament was already running at or above the target warmup setpoint. The firmware can transition out of the fault state and into warmup state after receiving a reset fault command from the PC.
<<<
